      "content": "My general advice for using AI for any purpose is to ask yourself: \"how do I make what I am doing even more ambitious?\"\n\nYou do this over and over until you either hit a wall and thus learn the shape of the jagged frontier (useful!) or you find out that the AI can do more than you think (common!)",
